# RAG System Integration Plan

This plan outlines the steps to integrate a specialized Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system into the existing intelligent financial application. This will allow the AI to answer complex queries by referencing specific uploaded documents (Bank Statements, GST Returns, ITRs, etc.) with high precision.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Vector Database**: This plan assumes the use of `pgvector` on the existing PostgreSQL instance. If `pgvector` cannot be installed on the environment, we will need to utilize a separate vector store like ChromaDB or Pinecone.
> 
> **Embedding Model**: We will use OpenAI's `text-embedding-3-small` or `text-embedding-ada-002` by default. Please ensure the `OPENAI_API_KEY` has quota for embeddings.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Infrastructure Layer
- **PostgreSQL Extension**: Install and enable `pgvector`.
- **Dependency**: Add `pgvector` support to Sequelize (if not already handled via raw queries or specialized plugins).

### 2. Data Modeling [NEW]
#### [NEW] [documentChunk.js](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/models/documentChunk.js)
Stores granular text chunks from documents with their associated vector embeddings.
- [id](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/services/truthValidationService.js#281-326): Primary Key
- `documentId`: Foreign Key to [Documents](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/controllers/documentController.js#95-135)
- `content`: Text snippet
- `embedding`: Vector column (dimension: 1536)
- `metadata`: JSON (page number, section, etc.)

### 3. AI Service Enhancements
#### [MODIFY] [aiProvider.js](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/utils/aiProvider.js)
- Add `getEmbeddings(text)` method to handle batch embedding generation using OpenAI.

### 4. RAG Engine
#### [NEW] [ragService.js](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/services/ragService.js)
The core orchestrator for indexing and retrieval.
- `indexDocument(documentId)`: Chunks the document text, generates embeddings, and saves to database.
- `search(query, userId, limit)`: Converts query to embedding and performs vector similarity search.

#### [NEW] [ragController.js](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/controllers/ragController.js)
- `GET /api/rag/query`: Endpoint for intelligent document-based Q&A.

### 5. Integration Points
#### [MODIFY] [documentAnalysisService.js](file:///Users/sahej/Desktop/financial-app/server/src/services/documentAnalysisService.js)
- Trigger `ragService.indexDocument` after successful OCR and classification.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Unit test for `getEmbeddings` in `aiProvider`.
- Integration test for `ragService` verifying that retrieved chunks are relevant to the query.

### Manual Verification
- Upload a test PDF, wait for processing, and then use the RAG query endpoint to ask a specific question found only in that document (e.g., "What was the total interest earned in June?").
